          "id": "3f65054bda660d3bcb0e68c03542156cbcc8777ec6d14cc6dfeae797dba5559b",
          "time": "2026-11-20T04:30:35+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Goolsbee: Inflation has proven to be far more persistent than was thought in 2025, and data center demand and AI-related wealth impact are adding to it."
        },
