          "id": "9ec586bfff0e6f5cdc2ad00799662c0876058fc9af74700d03531ee82bd4dd8f",
          "time": "2026-11-20T04:30:50+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Goolsbee: The steepness of the interest-rate path will be rooted in whether ‘borderline disturbingly high' inflation is seen returning to the Fed's 2% target."
        },
        {
          "id": "5ee987c2c110fe5586164c66c1067c9e757ade2ca9f82733f47f0fbdc4762895",
          "time": "2026-11-20T04:31:07+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Goolsbee: I do not see at this point that inflation is on the path back to 2%; it is not just coming from oil and tariff shocks, but also from a sizable demand component."
        },
        {
          "id": "b8fff33c632a95ac57c1dd779e353e7a187f085d3f87da37ee6ebe2189f7997c",
          "time": "2026-11-20T04:31:21+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Goolsbee: I am not concerned about wages pressuring inflation at this point."
        },
        {
          "id": "6088aa3562affa5404a88d539059ae87cfcd870e45e923d9276311f26bac2f20",
          "time": "2026-11-20T04:31:36+08:00",
          "central_bank": "FED",
          "headline": "Fed's Goolsbee: It has not been good news on inflation for the past few months."
